  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light Combo Kit contains WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light (1pcs), contains 3 Pin 10mm Cable (2pcs), and 3-pin 10mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors (10pcs). The 3-pin 10mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors and the 3 Pin 10mm Cable fit the WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light, making it the perfect DIY LED light accessory kit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Remote Control Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Click here to purchase a replacement for the remote control if you need one."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\"><!-- 文案布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light Combo Kit</strong></span> contains <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/ws2812b-rgb-led-strip-light\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"> WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light (1pcs) </span></strong></a>, contains <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/usb-a-power-cable-with-ph2-0-connector-copy?id=41923272933491&amp;skr=yes\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"> 3 Pin 10mm Cable (2pcs)</span></strong></a>, and <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/3-pin-10mm-l-shaped-led-strip-connectors?_pos=1&amp;_sid=442b5944c&amp;_ss=r&amp;skr=yes\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"> 3-pin 10mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors (10pcs).</span></strong></a> The 3-pin 10mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors and the 3 Pin 10mm Cable fit the WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light, making it the perfect DIY LED light accessory kit.</p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"></div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- 文案布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- 顶部图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_head-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"> <!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"White LED Light Strip\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/557552edff5b4714bdf8585c19d17f38/Group_48432.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"White LED Light Strip\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/557552edff5b4714bdf8585c19d17f38/Group_48432.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<strong><!-- table布局 --><!-- 物品清单布局结束 --><!-- 标题加文案 --></strong></div>\n<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"><strong> </strong></a></div>\n<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"><strong> </strong></a></div>\n<a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"><strong> </strong></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"> </a>\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"> </a>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"> </a>\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"> </a>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\"><a data-mce-block=\"true\" href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip?skr=yes\"><!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 --></a> <br/><!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Parameter</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Each pixel can be easily cut or soldered independently without damaging the remaining pixels. Also, the LED strip is constructed with a 50cm (1.6FT) Flexible Printed Circuit Board (FPCB), featuring a solder point at every 50cm interval. This design ensures convenient connectivity and easy customization along the strip.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/25498a82c53d4bfbbac2541c534d8a55/Group_48427.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/25498a82c53d4bfbbac2541c534d8a55/Group_48427.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><br/><!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">USB Control Instruction</h3>\n</div>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/fe9075c957e1493687f6720aeeeaae89/Group_48452_1.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/fe9075c957e1493687f6720aeeeaae89/Group_48452_1.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Remote Control Instruction</h3>\n</div>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Each button has multiple modes\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/88ffbbabf68849c0a325621f861daf87/Group_47926_7dd1033a-6627-4552-8fef-aaaa14832f6a.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Each button has multiple modes\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/88ffbbabf68849c0a325621f861daf87/Group_47926_7dd1033a-6627-4552-8fef-aaaa14832f6a.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"../../../products/led-light-strip-remote-controller\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Click here to purchase a replacement for the remote control if you need one.</span></strong></span></a></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">APP Control Instruction</h3>\n</div>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Scan the QR code on the USB controller to download the APP control\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/b135493787154526ac39a7c92b59ac40/app.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Scan the QR code on the USB controller to download the APP control\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/ca785821c3fc4eff9bc563bf75644531/KA001.png\" height=\"680\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"1630\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">In the box</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/ws2812b-rgb-led-strip-light\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light (1pcs) - KA001</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/usb-a-power-cable-with-ph2-0-connector-copy?id=41923272933491&amp;skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">3 Pin 10mm Cable (2PCS) - XC001</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/3-pin-10mm-l-shaped-led-strip-connectors?_pos=1&amp;_sid=442b5944c&amp;_ss=r&amp;skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">3-pin 10mm L-shaped LED Strip Connectors (10PCS) - XE001</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
